Package: zoraxy
Version: @VERSION@-@RELEASE@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/tobychui/zoraxy
Description: General purpose HTTP reverse proxy and forwarding tool
 Zoraxy is a general purpose HTTP reverse proxy and forwarding tool with a
 web management interface: TLS/ACME certificates, access control, load
 balancing, stream (TCP/UDP) proxy, statistics and plugins.
 .
 The service runs as the "zoraxy" user and keeps its data in /var/lib/zoraxy.
 Options are set in /etc/default/zoraxy.
